'}, 'source': '<a href="http://twitter.com/download/iphone" rel="nofollow">Twitter for iPhone</a>', 'note_tweet': {'is_expandable': True, 'note_tweet_results': {'result': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4ODQyNDQ5NTkzNDUyMzM5MjA=', 'text': 'Fascinating all the mRNA research and data coming out yet we are still wanting to push forward with mRNA technology without first addressing all the research showing injuries and possibly deaths due to mRNA. \n\n@thegarybrecka with @ShawnRyan762 @SRS_jeremy explains perfectly what a LOT of Veterans go through after service. Veterans exposed to countless chemicals and numerous Vaccines to include the Anthrax Vaccine which in the post below you will see another post explaining my theory on the Anthrax Vaccine and mRNA advancement. \n\nJeremy and Shawn please look at the stuff below. I think they moved on from Military Guinea pigs to our wives, kids, neighbors, and friends in this round. My family did not get and never will get an mRNA vaccine, however many did. And a lot of research is very convincing that possible shedding may actually be occurring. Plus if you dig deeper they have been looking at a lot of different ways to mass vaccinate populations without using needles. And we have funded many of those research projects under "Biodefense" which makes sense in TRUE Biodefense but NOT in "One Health" or "Global Health Security". \n\nPlease consider having on @MdBreathe @LTCTheresaLong @KLVeritas @NassMeryl @P_McCulloughMD \n\nMany veterans have suffered and died for many years from Chemicals and Vaccines brother. Suffered far beyond what is being reported as symptoms currently by Gary in the general population. I personally believe it’s because length of time. Mine didn’t fully take me for 20 years. I had symptoms like Gary explains but I could push through until others kicked in. Some Veterans its 1-2 years others it drops them 20 years later. \n\nIs that the fate of many Americans? Is it a “ticking time bomb” as @joerogan pointed out as a possibility? \n\nOverlapping Symptoms with Veteran Symptoms like Gary explains: Inflammation, Heart issues, mood disorders, cardiovascular disorders, hormone imbalances, mood numbness, join pain, neurological symptoms, memory loss, Mental Conditions, fatigue. \n\n"Then we throw these blanket diagnosis" Chronic Fatigue Symptom or Fibromyalgia. Sound familiar Veterans? Just like Gulf War Syndrome. \n\nI understand perhaps one day mRNA will be known as a true "miracle of science" like many call it, but right now it seems like we should pump the brakes and look at data and research before we open Pandora\'s box even further.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '1612243573449146369', 'name': 'Gary Brecka', 'screen_name': 'thegarybrecka', 'indices': [210, 224]}, {'id_str': '1104564502220161026', 'name': 'Shawn Ryan', 'screen_name': 'ShawnRyan762', 'indices': [230, 243]}, {'id_str': '1865108528815288320', 'name': 'Jeremy', 'screen_name': 'SRS_jeremy', 'indices': [244, 255]}, {'id_str': '1139217161275101184', 'name': 'Mary Talley Bowden MD', 'screen_name': 'MdBreathe', 'indices': [1171, 1181]}, {'id_str': '1421559749556858883', 'name': 'Theresa M Long, MD, MPH, FS', 'screen_name': 'LTCTheresaLong', 'indices': [1182, 1197]}, {'id_str': '1443993685209673729', 'name': 'Dr. Kat Lindley', 'screen_name': 'KLVeritas', 'indices': [1198, 1208]}, {'id_str': '2834323419', 'name': 'MERYL NASS, MD', 'screen_name': 'NassMeryl', 'indices': [1209, 1219]}, {'id_str': '1465347964252180493', 'name': 'Peter A. McCullough, MD, MPH®', 'screen_name': 'P_McCulloughMD', 'indices': [1220, 1235]}, {'id_str': '18208354', 'name': 'Joe Rogan', 'screen_name': 'joerogan', 'indices': [1734, 1743]}]}}}}, 'quoted_status_result': {'result': {'__typename': 'Tweet', 'rest_id': '1884240157185859765', 'core': {'user_results': {'result': {'__typename': 'User', 'id': 'VXNlcjoxNzUzMDI2NjA2NjQ4Mzk3ODI0', 'rest_id': '1753026606648397824', 'affiliates_highlighted_l